# oracle: fix oneway reverses the wrong-sign velocity component every N steps inside a region
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary f f f
region box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
region mid block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 single 3.0 3.0 3.0
create_atoms 1 single 1.6 3.0 3.0
create_atoms 1 single 4.4 3.0 3.0
mass 1 1.0
variable vx atom -0.02+0.01*sin(1.3*x+0.7*y)
variable vy atom 0.01*cos(0.9*y-0.4*z)
variable vz atom 0.01*sin(1.1*z+0.5*x)
velocity all set v_vx v_vy v_vz
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0
fix 1 all nve
fix 2 all oneway 5 mid x
thermo_style custom step pe ke press
thermo_modify format float %.15g norm no
thermo 10
run 100
